{"pin":"AB02359","subcodes":[{"code":"AB02359","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou who art steadfast in the Covenant! That which was written by thy musk-laden pen brought great joy to our hearts","first_line_orig":"از آيهء ‌مبارکهء قرآن ‌آتيناک سبعاً من المثانی سؤال نموده ‌بودی ، سبعاً من المثانی را علمای رسوم حواميم سبع  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"690","translations":[{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"}],"writing_refs":[{"type":"light","type_name":"Light of the World","language":"en","lang_name":"English"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS2.074-075x","source":"MAS2","locator":"074-075x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MAS2/mas2-75.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK4#170 p.193x","source":"MMK4","locator":"170 p.193x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/SWA4/swa4-196.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK5#306 p.223x","source":"MMK5","locator":"306 p.223x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/SWA5/swa5-226.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"NURA#68","source":"NURA","locator":"68","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/nur-i-afaq.pdf"},{"kind":"translation","code":"LOTW#68","source":"LOTW","locator":"68","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/114264723"}]}]}
